{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>雷宇揚離世｜因多次主演靈異節目而獲得「鬼王」之稱的雷宇揚，今日（11日）傳出因胃癌離世的消息，其遺孀已證實其死訊。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_7ec9de0f839fee2e-1989\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>據悉，雷宇揚早年曾罹患胃癌，至年前舊病復發，最終不敵病魔離世。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_7ec9de0f839fee2e-1989\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d398152a-92c9-467f-b973-3615f68221d4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026VPtFdqdE021789112679.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d398152a-92c9-467f-b973-3615f68221d4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_7ec9de0f839fee2e-1989\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_7ec9de0f839fee2e-1989\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>雷宇揚於1988年在 TVB 訓練班畢業，不時參與綜藝節目主持及參演電視劇，其後轉投電影圈發展。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_7ec9de0f839fee2e-1989\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fc838569-6230-4ae3-b25c-a09967ba9d48.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026leni1H2ft01789112679.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fc838569-6230-4ae3-b25c-a09967ba9d48.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"82f8d7d9-7b58-450d-85d3-5d58d42892bb.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ljB1EIO17L1789112679.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"82f8d7d9-7b58-450d-85d3-5d58d42892bb.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_7ec9de0f839fee2e-1989\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_7ec9de0f839fee2e-1989\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>近年他轉往商界發展，並選擇長居廣州生活，與香港演藝圈中人鮮有來往，幾乎絕跡所有公開聚會。他對上一次現身在大眾視野，大約是5年前與吳啟華、林韋辰合拍短片。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T08:21:11.047879+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}